  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Wix is a website builder with integrated ecommerce. US annual tiles commonly published 2026: Light ~$17/mo (site, no store), Core ~$29/mo (accept payments / basic ecommerce), Business ~$39/mo, Business Elite ~$159/mo; monthly billing is higher. Free plan exists but does not unlock selling. Best for design-led SMBs that need a site and a store together — not a Shopify-class commerce OS. Pricing research 2026-08-18 from consistent first-party plan reporting; confirm live on wix.com/pricing.",
